  "goodToKnow": "Die Lebensfreude is zest for life or joie de vivre: voller Lebensfreude, Lebensfreude ausstrahlen. Germans often associate it with the Rhineland and Carnival or with southern Europe: die italienische Lebensfreude. Lebensfroh means cheerful. Similar compounds: die Lebenslust, die Lebensqualität (quality of life), der Lebensmut (will to live). It has no plural."
